<title>INDIA: India 96/97 steel output estimated at 22.55 mln T.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 steel output estimated at 22.55 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 22.55 million tonnes of finished steel during 1996/97 (April-March), up from 21.40 million in the previous year, a Steel Ministry statement said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The country's exports of finished steel during 1996/97 was estimated at 1.5 million tonnes compared with 1.1 million in the previous year, an increase of 33.3 percent, the ministry said.</p>
<p>It said consumption of finished steel during 1996/97 was 22.18 million tonnes, a 2.4 percent increase over the previous year.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
